WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.510 --> 00:00:03.290
Whoa!

00:00:03.290 --> 00:00:05.930
It's a box fit for a king, it is.

00:00:05.930 --> 00:00:06.740
As it should be.

00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:09.920
We are delivering it to the King of Space
himself.

00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:13.640
A real-life king? This could be my big chance
to grovel.

00:00:21.510 --> 00:00:23.310
Ooh. Swanky dump.

00:00:24.510 --> 00:00:26.550
Your delivery, my liege.

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:31.090
Now this guy knows how to grovel.

00:00:31.110 --> 00:00:32.070
Yes!

00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:38.880
At last, the portrait of my late wife has
arrived. Careful. It's delicate.

00:00:40.980 --> 00:00:43.800
Infinita, Queen of Space.

00:00:43.830 --> 00:00:47.940
Not even the finest macaroni artist could
capture your beauty.

00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:48.990
Although this one did.

00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:50.160
Hang it over there.

00:00:54.240 --> 00:00:55.590
Oh, sorry.

00:00:55.620 --> 00:00:57.660
It's my early onset sciatica.

00:00:59.370 --> 00:01:03.690
Announcing His Royal Highness the Prince of
Space.

00:01:04.110 --> 00:01:06.120
Allow me to help your elderly friend.

00:01:13.280 --> 00:01:17.720
Wow. This absolute stud sure made me look
like a wimp, huh, Leela?

00:01:17.720 --> 00:01:22.670
You guys straighten that together while I explain our loyalty
punch card program to His Majesty.

